# Convex

- Run `pnpm exec convex dev` so `convex/_generated` exists before editing backend code.
- Prefer validators on public `query` / `mutation` args and returns.
- Await all Convex DB and scheduler calls.
- Auth/tenants: use existing npm packages (`@convex-dev/auth`, `@djpanda/*`) — not `@script-augur`.
